# 🔐 Authentication Implementation Plan — Sign In & Sign Up

## 1. Current Architecture Snapshot

| Layer | Existing Packages | Pattern |
|---|---|---|
| **Presentation** | `assistant/`, `home/`, `services/`, `search/`, `details/` | Stateless Composable Screen + ViewModel + UiState data class |
| **Domain** | `model/`, `repository/` | Interface contracts, data classes |
| **Data** | `repository/` | In-memory implementations |
| **Core** | `navigation/`, `ui/theme/` | Single `NavHost` in `MServiceApp`, sealed `Screen` routes, Material 3 theme |
| **Entry Point** | `MainActivity` | Single-activity, edge-to-edge, delegates to `MServiceApp()` |

**Key conventions already established:**
- ViewModels use `MutableStateFlow` / `StateFlow` (no LiveData)
- UI state encapsulated in a dedicated `*UiState` data class
- Factory pattern for ViewModel construction (`ViewModelProvider.Factory`)
- Navigation via sealed `Screen` class with type-safe routes
- Composable screens are stateless — receive callbacks, no direct nav references

