## 2. Authentication Feature Overview

### What We're Building

A **local-first authentication layer** that gates access to the main app behind a Sign In / Sign Up flow. Authentication state is persisted via Android's `DataStore (Preferences)` — no backend server required for this phase.

> [!NOTE]
> This plan is designed to be **backend-agnostic**. The domain layer defines interfaces that can later be swapped to Firebase Auth, a custom REST API, or any identity provider without touching the UI layer.

