### How Data Flows (Sign In Example)

```
1. User types email + password → SignInScreen captures input
2. SignInScreen calls viewModel.onSignIn()
3. SignInViewModel:
   a. Validates input (email format, password length)
   b. Updates UiState → isLoading = true
   c. Calls authRepository.signIn(email, password)
4. LocalAuthRepository:
   a. Checks stored credentials in DataStore
   b. Returns AuthResult.Success(user) or AuthResult.Error(message)
5. SignInViewModel:
   a. On Success → UiState.isAuthenticated = true
   b. On Error  → UiState.error = "Invalid credentials"
6. SignInScreen observes UiState:
   a. isAuthenticated → NavController navigates to Home
   b. error → Shows Snackbar/inline error
```

