## 5. Dependency Addition

```kotlin
// app/build.gradle.kts — add to dependencies block:
implementation("androidx.datastore:datastore-preferences:1.1.4")
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> DataStore is the recommended replacement for SharedPreferences. It provides:
> - Coroutine-based async API (no blocking main thread)
> - Type safety via Preferences keys
> - Atomic read-modify-write operations

