## 6. Validation Rules

| Field | Rules |
|---|---|
| **Name** (Sign Up only) | Not blank, ≥ 2 characters |
| **Email** | Not blank, valid format (`Patterns.EMAIL_ADDRESS`) |
| **Password** | ≥ 8 characters, at least 1 uppercase, 1 lowercase, 1 digit |
| **Confirm Password** | Must match Password field |

All validation is performed **client-side** in the ViewModel before calling the repository.

