## 8. Security Considerations

| Concern | Approach |
|---|---|
| Password storage | SHA-256 hashed before storing in DataStore — never stored as plain text |
| Session persistence | Lightweight token (UUID) stored in DataStore; checked at app start |
| Sign-out | Clears all auth data from DataStore |
| Future-proofing | `AuthRepository` interface makes it trivial to swap to Firebase Auth, OAuth, or a REST API |

